{"ID":"20240314091914-go821yc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091914-go821yc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091914-go821yc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165328-e60viis\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165328-h2dxji0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:363,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165328-h2dxji0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【黄土汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165328-e60viis","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-e60viis","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下血，先便后血，此远血也，黄土汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-yvua0po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-yvua0po","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄土汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-pq0ouqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-pq0ouqo","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草干地黄白朮附子各三两炮阿胶三两黄芩三两竈中黄土半斤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-0w3ofjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-0w3ofjb","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水八升，煑取三升，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-41kbaqk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-41kbaqk","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃癌专治"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-qscea7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-qscea7q","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下面介绍的这个处方，是我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗胃癌的主力方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那你如果病人有出血，你用这个处方配合刚刚的柏叶汤，吞不下东西配合上利膈汤，那你不用管它在食道哪个位置上，在贲门位置上，亦或在胃的部分，这样了解吧？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下血，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便里面带血，刚刚是吐血，吐血和下血千万不要搞错了哦，一个人在吐血，你给他吃黄土汤，下血的时候吃柏叶汤，鸡同鸭讲。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-mlowq3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-mlowq3f","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"先便后血"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便先出来，再排血出来，这是远血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，意思就是当你的胃有出血或是肠子里面出血，经过了小肠再经过了大肠排出来的血，这么远呐，这血已经缺氧，所以大便是黑色，这时候马桶一冲，水一下后，你就看到红色，这是肠胃里面出血了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-4jeoph3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-4jeoph3","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这黄土汤呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃出血，胃下垂，胃溃疡，胃癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，统统可以使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-0vx5e74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-0vx5e74","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在美国看病时，我们经验太多了，那个病人跟我说我大便里面是黑的，常常呕酸，就已经讲完了。我说你喝咖啡，你怎么知道，我每天喝咖啡喝一大碗。那你如果不知道病因，那你怎么治他？治不好。所以我跟他说，你要 overnight recover还是要拖，看你自己，他说我当然要 overnight，好咖啡不要喝了，甜食不要吃了，就恢复的非常得快，就是这个黄土汤，我治疗了很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-pidpe5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-pidpe5p","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那大家看这个黄土汤，因为病人有出血，所以用地黄补他的血，白术和甘草都是健脾整胃的，用炮附子是因为胃寒，阿胶是止血。现在看到黄芩，我们有好多种泻心汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三黄泻心汤，半夏泻心汤，甘草泻心汤，生姜泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，老师那么多的泻心汤我会搞错，没关系我教你，慢慢教起来哦，我就不相信教你不会。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你胃里面有发炎的时候，黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你小肠里面有炎的时候，黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是黄芩和黄连差异的地方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你心脏过热或是心虚的时候，所谓虚就是阴虚，血不够的时候，舌苔是黄的，就是这个黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以这个黄连呢是入心脏，因为它苦太苦了，苦味入心，心同小肠相表里。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏呢跟这里完全不相干，黄柏入膀胱，入水道系统"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以就是这三黄汤...所以就是因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩，黄连，黄柏，三个处方三个药加在一起的时候，它可以从胃里一直消毒到小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以消毒到水的系统，所以就变成解毒汤，身上的毒比如说你是食物中毒，或是肾脏病的尿液回流，这个浊物跑到血里面去，也是解毒汤，这是我给大家一个基本的概念。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-xu8085z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-xu8085z","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这里是胃，所以我们要用什么，用黄芩，不用黄连黄柏，（竈）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"灶中黄土"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，现在市面上你去买的时候，或者你开"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"灶心土"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，或者是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"伏龙肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，老师这个很好听啊就是灶心土嘛。现在台北呢我们都用瓦丝没有灶心土，这个灶心土呢经过几年，或十几年烤过以后，这种土最好，灶心土就补消破洞的地方，那临床上面你只要看到胃癌，病人有下血，大便是黑色，你就可以开这个处方，那有好几种胃癌，中医的看法是这样子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不管西医讲什么胃癌，我们中医分这几种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人吐血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我的病人呢三更半夜，晚上在家里面吐血，吐得床上都是血，然后呢跑到急诊处去，一看胃癌，开刀拿掉。想想这怎么可以啊，胃没有了怎么可以啊？换家医院，再去检查，胃癌，一样的结果，开刀。好，没办法拉，跑来找我们，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人吐血又下血，黄土汤和柏叶汤加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吃两个礼拜，然后病人再回到同样的医院去检查，然后那个医生说你很好啊，没有胃癌你来干吗？也不知道这个病人两个礼拜前来找过他，医生问你为什么跑来，病人说医生我来检查下胃。你的胃很好呀你看里面都没有问题，我胃里有点难过，里面红红的有点发炎，可是医生两个礼拜前说我有胃癌，什么？叫护士调出资料来一看，的确是胃癌，吓一跳啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-u9kynml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-u9kynml","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是你要知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗这个病时，甜食要停掉，咖啡要停掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"呕酸很重时，就加旋复花"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋复花、代赭石，各三钱，来去酸，这就是加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果病人今天来"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有吐血，没有下血，只是胃酸呕吐的很厉害，旋覆花代赭石就够了。旋复花，代赭石，生姜，甘草，大枣下去就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但是你如果说你不知道这个酸是因为他吃甜的，喝咖啡来的，病还是会照犯。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-zxhldxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-zxhldxa","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这次你们去美国，我们有一个好朋友，他在奥兰多，他是一个基督教教会里面的一个头子，跟我很好，那我们在一起打麻将啊。他喝咖啡，那么大一杯，一天十几杯，我说不行，胃会有问题，不是胃癌就是胰脏癌，他说有你在我怕什么。不幸被我言中，发病了，发病后他刚好在台湾，他连夜买票坐飞机到美国找我，太太还在台湾，太太也不管了先跑回来找我，就是我把他治好了，到现在他看到咖啡就逃走了，你叫他喝也不敢喝，吓死了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-0yn8bjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-0yn8bjv","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个黄土汤呢除了肠胃出血以外，还有一种症用到...病人呢精神错乱，昏迷了，有幻觉，会产生幼觉，不断的摇手，中医的观念呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"土能胜水而平木"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当我们去强土的时候，可以制水，水肿就不会来了，肝木就会平下去，这是一个治症的法则，好像一个公式一样，所以当我们用黄土汤去强脾胃，病人是不断的动，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"动症都是肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以黄土汤吃下去，跟它风马牛不相干的，只因为黄土汤是土而已，结果精神突然也好了，所以这个治症的观念一定要有。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165328-h2dxji0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165328-h2dxji0","updated":"20240422165328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，买不到灶心土，你就用赤石脂可取代它。"}]}]}